behavior transfers one step farther into the validated four-stage Task-4
environment without retraining or authority increase.

SCIENTIFIC QUESTION

On ten fresh paired Task-4 worlds, does the accepted 25-percent learned U
blend causally change developmental recruitment while preserving the
validated exact-parent Task-4 functional envelope?

